 "name_en": "Customer Returns for Non-Stock and Service Materials (3TE)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Customer Returns for Non-Stock and Service Materials (3TE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa387eab23a004243baeb61943365670e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa387eab23a004243baeb61943365670e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">A non-stock or service material can be used in the returns order. Non-stock and service materials are not included in inventory management. With creation of a returns delivery, the goods receipt is reflected by a confirmation posting. Non-stock and service items can be handled along with stock items in one returns order.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The user can influence when the refunding documents are created: either directly when releasing a returns order, or after materials are received physically. Finally, the user can decide on the compensation type for the customer: paying a credit memo or shipping a replacement.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa387eab23a004243baeb61943365670e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create returns order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate returns delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receive (statistical confirmation)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine refund</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo or send replacement free of charge</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa387eab23a004243baeb61943365670e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Take back items from your customer that do not need maintenance in inventory, simplifying data entry for the items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate return of non-stock and service materials fully in returns order processing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Decide immediate on compensation options</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>非库存和服务物料的客户退货 (3TE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa387eab23a004243baeb61943365670e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa387eab23a004243baeb61943365670e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">非库存或服务物料可用于退货订单。非库存和服务物料不包括在库存管理中。创建退货交货后，收货将由确认过账反映。非库存和服务项目可以与库存项目在一个退货订单中处理。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">用户可以影响创建退款凭证的时间：直接在下达退货订单时，或者在实际收到物料后。最后，用户可以决定客户的补偿类型：支付贷项凭证或装运替换。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa387eab23a004243baeb61943365670e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建退货订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">生成退货交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账收货（统计确认）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确定退款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建贷项凭证或免费发送替换</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa387eab23a004243baeb61943365670e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">从客户处收回不需要在库存中维护的项目，简化项目的数据输入</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将非库存和服务物料的退货完全集成到退货订单处理中。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">立即决定薪酬选项</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
